                <pb facs="0813" n="719" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg719"/>

                <head>No. 462.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Manning to Mr. Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-05-05"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 5, 1887</date>.
                        (Received May 5.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Gutierrez and the colonel who rescued him and another officer have been sentenced
                    to death at Nogales.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Manning</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
